[[3,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2752486\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752945\">5510C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752826\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752558\">1092B60</a></p><p>1. Open the wiring protective cover.</p><p>2. Undo the fixing nut (2a) and disconnect the alternator electrical\nwiring (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Starter&#x27; motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>A20A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Starter&#x27; motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>A20B</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Undo the bolts (3a) and remove alternator (3b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046949.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the alternator in its seating and loosely\ntighten the fixing bolts.</p><p>Connect the alternator wiring and tighten\nthe fixing nuts.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Starter&#x27; motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>A20A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Starter&#x27; motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>A20B</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2752558\">1092B60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752559\">1092B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752826\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752945\">5510C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752486\">1048A10</a></p>"]]